  "title": "Our Websites Might Get Weird",
  "summary": "Howdy all, Now that we’ve migrated to Route 53 (see other thread for that), Ilia is enabling Cloudfront on our website and new software repositories (all but forum and old software.virtualmin.com). This might break www.virtualmin.com and the new download.virtualmin.com websites. If it breaks, we probably already know about it, and are working on a fix. But, I figured I’d post about it, just in case. Cheers, Joe",
